<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the final</p>
<p>day of a four-day Red Stripe Cup match on Monday:</p>
<p>In Anguilla: Jamaica v Leeward Islands match drawn. Jamaica</p>
<p>332 and 199-5 Leeward Islands 234 (B.Murphy 5-85).</p>
</text>
